OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AUK asks Apple to widen access to its
OL,4,Apayment tech
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK smartphone users could benefit from
OL,7,Fnew payment, ticket and travel apps if
OL,8,FApple widens access to its contactless
OL,9,Fpayment tech, the competition watchdog
OL,10,Fsays.
OL,12,FThe Competition and Markets Authority
OL,13,F(CMA) also wants the fees Apple charges
OL,14,Ffirms to use its contactless tech to be
OL,15,F"substantially lower".
OL,17,FIt believes the iPhone maker's current
OL,18,Ffees and charges are "blocking"
OL,19,Ffinancial technology firms and others
OL,20,Ffrom innovating and growing - and is
OL,21,Fconsulting on proposals it believes
OL,22,Fwould cause these fees to fall.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,116,105,200,160,0,100
